{"seq":3,"slug":"galaxy-astronomy","title":"星系天文学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.25,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 星系天文学\n\n星系天文学是研究银河系及河外星系的结构、形成、演化与分布规律的天文学分支。从我们所在的银河系到遥远宇宙边缘的高红移星系，这一领域覆盖了从千秒差距到吉秒差距的广阔尺度范围。\n\n## 学习目标\n\n- 掌握银河系的多组分结构（银盘、核球、暗物质晕）及旋臂动力学\n- 理解星系形态分类体系（Hubble 序列）与物理驱动机制\n- 认识活动星系核（AGN）的统一模型及超大质量黑洞的观测证据\n- 了解宇宙大尺度结构（星系团、宇宙网）的层级组织方式\n\n## 章节概览\n\n| 章节   | 主题           | 核心内容                           |\n| ------ | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 第一章 | 银河系结构     | 银盘旋臂、银心 Sgr A\\*、暗物质晕   |\n| 第二章 | 星系分类与演化 | Hubble 序列、形成理论、并合过程    |\n| 第三章 | 活动星系核     | AGN 统一模型、类星体、超大质量黑洞 |\n| 第四章 | 大尺度结构     | 星系团、宇宙网、大型巡天项目       |\n\n## 前沿进展\n\n近年来该领域取得突破性进展：Event Horizon Telescope（EHT）于 2022 年发布银心黑洞 Sgr A\\* 首张图像；James Webb Space Telescope（JWST）自 2022 年运行以来持续发现红移 z > 10 的早期星系，挑战了现有星系形成模型；Euclid 空间望远镜（2023 年发射）正在开展前所未有的宇宙大尺度结构巡天。这些观测数据正在重塑我们对星系起源与演化的认知。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"milky-way-structure","title":"银河系结构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/milky-way-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"galactic-disk-spiral","title":"银盘与旋臂结构","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/milky-way-structure/galactic-disk-spiral"},{"seq":2,"slug":"galactic-center","title":"银河系中心与 Sgr A\\*","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/milky-way-structure/galactic-center"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dark-matter-halo","title":"暗物质晕","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/milky-way-structure/dark-matter-halo"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"galaxy-classification-evolution","title":"星系分类与演化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/galaxy-classification-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hubble-sequence","title":"哈勃序列与形态分类","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/galaxy-classification-evolution/hubble-sequence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"galaxy-formation-theory","title":"星系形成理论","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/galaxy-classification-evolution/galaxy-formation-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"galaxy-mergers-interactions","title":"星系并合与相互作用","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/galaxy-classification-evolution/galaxy-mergers-interactions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"active-galactic-nuclei","title":"活动星系核","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/active-galactic-nuclei","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agn-unified-model","title":"AGN 统一模型","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/active-galactic-nuclei/agn-unified-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quasars-blazars","title":"类星体与耀变体","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/active-galactic-nuclei/quasars-blazars"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supermassive-black-holes","title":"超大质量黑洞","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/active-galactic-nuclei/supermassive-black-holes"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"large-scale-structure","title":"大尺度结构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/large-scale-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"galaxy-clusters","title":"星系团","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/large-scale-structure/galaxy-clusters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cosmic-web","title":"宇宙网","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/large-scale-structure/cosmic-web"},{"seq":3,"slug":"galaxy-surveys","title":"星系巡天","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/large-scale-structure/galaxy-surveys"}]}]}